{"start": "id:180", "start_label": "West House", "start_score": 0}
{"step": 1, "before": "id:180", "after": "id:180", "before_label": "West House", "after_label": "West House", "action": "open mailbox", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Opening the small mailbox reveals a leaflet.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 2, "before": "id:180", "after": "id:81", "before_label": "West House", "after_label": "North House", "action": "north", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "North of House\nYou are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all the windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 3, "before": "id:81", "after": "id:79", "before_label": "North House", "after_label": "Behind House", "action": "east", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "Behind House\nYou are behind the white house. A path leads into the forest to the east. In one corner of the house there is a small window which is slightly ajar.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 4, "before": "id:79", "after": "id:79", "before_label": "Behind House", "after_label": "Behind House", "action": "open window", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 0, "delta": 0, "result": "With great effort, you open the window far enough to allow entry.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 5, "before": "id:79", "after": "id:203", "before_label": "Behind House", "after_label": "Kitchen", "action": "west", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 10, "result": "Kitchen\nYou are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark staircase can be seen leading upward. A dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open.\nOn the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.\nA bottle is sitting on the table.\nThe glass bottle contains:\n  A quantity of water\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 6, "before": "id:203", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Kitchen", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "west", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "Living Room\nYou are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy case, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.\nAbove the trophy case hangs an elvish sword of great antiquity.\nA battery-powered brass lantern is on the trophy case.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 7, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "take lantern", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "Taken.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": ["brass lantern"], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 8, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "push rug", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "With a great effort, the rug is moved to one side of the room, revealing the dusty cover of a closed trap door.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 9, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:193", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Living Room", "action": "open trap", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 10, "delta": 0, "result": "The door reluctantly opens to reveal a rickety staircase descending into darkness.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 10, "before": "id:193", "after": "id:72", "before_label": "Living Room", "after_label": "Cellar", "action": "down", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 25, "result": "You have moved into a dark place.\nThe trap door crashes shut, and you hear someone barring it.\n\nIt is pitch black. You are likely to be eaten by a grue.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 11, "before": "id:72", "after": "id:72", "before_label": "Cellar", "after_label": "Cellar", "action": "turn on lantern", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 0, "result": "The brass lantern is now on.\n\nCellar\nYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is unclimbable.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 12, "before": "id:72", "after": "id:71", "before_label": "Cellar", "after_label": "East Chasm", "action": "south", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 0, "result": "East of Chasm\nYou are on the east edge of a chasm, the bottom of which cannot be seen. A narrow passage goes north, and the path you are on continues to the east.\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
{"step": 13, "before": "id:71", "after": "id:72", "before_label": "East Chasm", "after_label": "Cellar", "action": "north", "source": "smart_actor", "score": 35, "delta": 0, "result": "Cellar\n\n", "relocation": false, "inventory_added": [], "inventory_removed": []}
